&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Enablement and Distribution Coordination:&lt;/strong&gt; Train, support, and equip internal sales teams, broker networks, and general agencies (GAs) with updated materials for quoting engines and decision-support platforms. Gather regional broker feedback to optimize day-to-day conversion deltas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Launch Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Project manage day-to-day product lifecycles and county expansions. Act as the primary interface between Product and Sales to organize feature updates, compliance filings, and workflow timelines ahead of high-volume Open Enrollment (OE) cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
