&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or 4 years of relevant experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 3+ years of experience leading GTM campaign execution specifically for health insurance, FinTech, or digital consumer health products. Track record managing project timelines and creative assets under strict deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
