&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Business, Healthcare, Economics, Mathematics, Statistics, Finance, or related field or equivalent work experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in product, analytics, strategy, consulting, or insurance-related roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to ACA individual and QHP products (including Small Group)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and ability to manage multiple deliverables simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work cross-functionally in a fast-paced, deadline driven environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating in cross-functional, fast-paced environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, structured problem-solving, and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel to 25% of the time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
