&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in English and Spanish, with exceptional written, verbal, and presentation skills in both languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience designing and delivering instructor-led and virtual training programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience coaching sales professionals, agents, brokers, or partner organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation and facilitation skills with the ability to engage audiences of varying experience levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating sales enablement content including presentations, training guides, videos, and digital learning resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to simplify complex insurance, healthcare, and technology concepts into actionable learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using webinar platforms (Zoom, GoToWebinar, Teams, etc.) and Learning Management Systems (LMS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management, organization, and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Microsoft Office, Google Workspace, and presentation software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
