&lt;li&gt;Manage insurance product execution calendar from design translation through filing, implementation, and ongoing optimization; operate as the hub of the department PMO activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure agreement between product intent, regulatory requirements, and operational outputs in partnership with the Strategic Programs Organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with insurance product leadership to translate strategy into relevant execution plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote performance tracking and process improvement&lt;/li&gt;
