&lt;li&gt;Coordinate inputs to ensure filing readiness and timeline adherence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage responses to regulatory objections and escalations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;QA &amp;amp; Operational Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage QA frameworks, validation processes, and quality standards for product execution and filing outputs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish execution rhythms, milestones, and governance across the lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote process standardization and continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolve risks, dependencies, and data inconsistencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement reporting to track progress, risks, and performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee production readiness and release schedules for filing outputs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enforce controls (e.g., freeze windows, change governance) during critical periods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage version control standards to ensure outputs are accurate and traceable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Vendor &amp;amp; Cross-Functional Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be an escalation point for vendors supporting product execution and QA, managing performance and delivery&lt;/li&gt;
