&lt;strong&gt;Requirements: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in insurance product (IFP and Small Group) execution, regulatory filings, and related roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years experience managing people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years hands-on experience with health insurance regulatory filing processes, specifically ACA and state specific regulatory filings / environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of proven experience leading complex QA and production workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years experience of understanding of controls, documentation standards and version management&lt;/li&gt;
