&lt;p&gt;Hi, we&#39;re Oscar. We&#39;re hiring a Group Product Manager, Lucie Platform to join our Product Management team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oscar is the first health insurance company built around a full stack technology platform and a relentless focus on serving our members. We started Oscar in 2012 to create the kind of health insurance company we would want for ourselves—one that behaves like a doctor in the family.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lucie Health Marketplace is a new all-in-one storefront that will change how Americans shop for healthcare. Lucie connects consumers and brokers to every major individual market plan and a curated menu of ancillary and supplemental products.&amp;nbsp;We’re hiring a Group Product Manager to lead our PM team on the Lucie enrollment platform.&amp;nbsp;This platform is the enrollment infrastructure that powers the broker, consumer, and employer experiences on Lucie. As a Group Product Manager you will lead EDE platform product strategy, partnering closely with Engineering, Data, and Design teams while&amp;nbsp;managing a team of product managers. You&#39;ll prioritize the enrollment platform roadmap, balancing initiatives across growth, compliance, usability, and strategic partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report into a Director of Product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Location: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
