&lt;li&gt;The Manager, Data Analytics works closely across and outside the organization to solve complex data issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role works collaboratively to triage data related issues, understand the root cause of those issues, and partner with the engineering, data, and customer success teams to implement solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Manager, Data Analytics understands the use, flow, and generation of data within a complex ecosystem of business processes and is able to articulate their findings to audiences with varying degrees of technical knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The role works both independently and with customers and with teammates to dig deeply and fully understand these issues within data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Manager, Data Analytics works to drive the scoping &amp;amp; execution of analytical requests, including working with stakeholders to define key questions, scope methodologies, and drive results. This role may, at times, be called upon to speak to prepared analyses internally and externally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
