&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for communicating with external customers and internal teams to fully understand and triage data issues, serving as the first point of contact for production issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ask questions to drive at the root cause and business impacts of issues that are raised surrounding our data&lt;/li&gt;
