&lt;li&gt;Analyze healthcare market trends, consumer behaviors, competitor activity, and product performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop market research summaries, dashboards, presentations, and strategic insights for company partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support competitive intelligence through data gathering and analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help develop market analyses, consumer segmentation, and opportunity assessments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with team members to support research requests and strategic programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compile and maintain market intelligence databases, reports, and recurring deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex data into concise, relevant insights for business audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support qualitative and quantitative research projects, including surveys, interviews, and market assessments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to continuous improvement of research methodologies and reporting processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compliance with all applicable laws and regulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
