&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in business, marketing, economics, healthcare administration, public health, or related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in market analytics, competitive intelligence, healthcare strategy, or related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to summarize information into clear business recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel up to 25% of the time&lt;/li&gt;
