&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sell-side and market intelligence.&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor sell-side coverage, consensus estimates, and peer and industry developments, compare analyst models to internal expectations, and synthesize analyst and investor sentiment into concise insights for key stakeholders across the organization, including executive management.&lt;/li&gt;
