&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Targeting and outreach.&lt;/strong&gt; Leverage data and analytics to identify and target investors, and support the development and execution of outreach and engagement strategies that strengthen and diversify the shareholder base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shareholder and market intelligence. &lt;/strong&gt;Track ownership and trading activity through stock-surveillance partners and report trends and insights to key stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
