&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Finance, Accounting, Economics, or a related field, or equivalent work experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years experience in investor relations or sell-side equity research.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to translate&amp;nbsp; complex financial and business information into clear, concise, and insightful messages for internal and external audiences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong financial and analytical skills, including financial modeling and valuation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills with exceptional attention to detail and accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be willing to travel up to 25%.&lt;/li&gt;
