&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience managing complex Provider Network strategies and negotiating complex contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of people management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years experience in Health Insurance (Individual and/or Medicare Advantage) and/or Healthcare industry&lt;/li&gt;
