&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PA or DNP, FNP, ENP from accredited program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Board Certification (AANP, ANCC, or NCCPA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compact RN (NP only)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Clinical Documentation Improvement and/or managing HEDIS quality measures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PA: Licensed in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Georgia&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;and &lt;/em&gt;one of the following states: &lt;strong&gt;Florida, Texas, or Ohio&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
