&lt;li&gt;Board Certification (NP: ANCC, PA: PA-C)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bilingual (Spanish - read, write, and speak).&amp;nbsp; &lt;em&gt;Must be able to successfully complete a fluency assessment (verbal and written).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Current full practice licensure in at least 3 of the following states: FL, TX, OH, NJ, GA (&lt;em&gt;active at the time of submitting application)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
