&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Board certification as an MD or DO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Licensed in one of these states: FL, NC, AZ &lt;em&gt;OR&lt;/em&gt; possess an active Interstate Medical Licensure Compact (IMLC).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of clinical practice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
