&lt;li&gt;2+ years experience in a technical role (QA analyst, PM, operations analyst, finance, consulting, industrial engineering) or a process improvement role (Six Sigma or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience working with large data sets using excel or a database language&lt;/li&gt;
