&lt;p&gt;Hi, we&#39;re Oscar. We&#39;re hiring an Senior Analyst, Regulatory Affairs to join our Regulatory Affairs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oscar is the first health insurance company built around a full stack technology platform and a relentless focus on serving our members. We started Oscar in 2012 to create the kind of health insurance company we would want for ourselves—one that behaves like a doctor in the family.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Analyst, Regulatory Affairs is a contributor and owner of mission critical workflows to maintain and operate the Independent Dispute Resolution process.&amp;nbsp; In assigned jurisdictions, you will intake disputes from providers, engage in negotiation with business unit support, perform all relevant admin functions, and ultimately prepare arbitration briefing where needed. You will keep tabs on developments to No Surprises Act policies and support the Regulatory Affairs function in serving as an enterprise wide resource on public policy and IDR trends.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report into the Director, Regulatory Affairs.&lt;/p&gt;
