&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Independent Dispute Resolution is a huge plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in personal injury law firms or as a paralegal&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the Affordable Care Act and the No Surprises Act&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with the individual and/or group markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with attorneys and internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
