&lt;p&gt;Hi, we&#39;re Oscar. We&#39;re hiring a Senior Director, Escalated Provider Issue Resolution to join our Network &amp;amp; Provider Management team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oscar is the first health insurance company built around a full stack technology platform and a relentless focus on serving our members. We started Oscar in 2012 to create the kind of health insurance company we would want for ourselves—one that behaves like a doctor in the family.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Director, Escalated Provider Issue Resolution team supports strategic provider accounts, high-complexity escalations, root-cause remediation, and provider service governance. This role will build and scale the operating model for escalated provider issue resolution, lead a multi-disciplinary team, and partner across Claims, Network, Utilization Management, Payment Integrity, Contact Center, Account Management, Technology, Analytics, and senior leadership to improve how Oscar identifies, routes, resolves, and prevents provider issues. This position will report to the SVP, Network and Provider Management.&lt;/p&gt;
