&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years experience in healthcare strategy, insurance product strategy, consulting, or strategic planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years people leadership experience managing multi-level teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in ACA individual and small group QHP markets&lt;/li&gt;
