&lt;li&gt;12+ years of experience in healthcare provider contracting, network development, or related areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years experience negotiating complex contracts with hospitals, physician groups, and other healthcare providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of leadership or managerial experience in a healthcare setting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
