&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of IT engineering experience supporting large-scale enterprise environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in enterprise-level Zendesk Administration and architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IAM Integration Expertise: Proven experience creating integrations within Zendesk for Identity and Access Management (IAM) tools such as Okta, IIQ, or homegrown solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Scripting: Ability to write scripts in Python or BASH for customized reporting, API interactions, and advanced workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
