&lt;li&gt;Partner with teams, and external partners and/or consultants, to:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;provide technical accounting expertise to support new transactions and new or evolving business arrangements, and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;prepare technical accounting analysis on complex accounting issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
