&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of relevant experience in Identity engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing or implementing identity and access management controls for enterprise systems, cloud environments, SaaS platforms, or internally built applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of least privilege, role-based and attribute-based access control, privileged access patterns, identity lifecycle management, and access review processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with identity platforms such as Okta, Google Workspace Identity, and Google Cloud permission models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of authentication and authorization protocols such as SAML, OAuth, OIDC, SCIM, LDAP, and related session, token, and federation patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
