&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security &amp;amp; Networking:&lt;/strong&gt; Knowledge of cloud-native security (IAM, VPC peering) and service mesh technologies like Istio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programming:&lt;/strong&gt; Understanding of at least one coding language that you are able to use to develop scripts and software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; B.S. in Computer Science, a related technical field, or equivalent high-level industry experience.&lt;/li&gt;
