&lt;li&gt;Independent contributor to their team. Work effectively across the codebase with appropriate guidance from code owners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make steady, well-paced progress without requiring frequent significant feedback from more senior engineers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compliance with all applicable laws and regulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
