&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience in provider network operations or contracting or provider services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of experience in Health Insurance (Individual and/or Medicare Advantage) and/or Healthcare industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years experience navigating and organizing large data sets such as claim files and provider rosters&lt;/li&gt;
