&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;With support from leadership, help identify risks; respond to and resolve issues/errors/escalations through investigation to inform insights for short/medium/long-term technology-enabled processes and solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate projects and processes to help ensure you meet important milestones and service levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with leadership to strategize arrangements aimed at lowering overall cost or improving outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with all relevant team member groups to provide support and insight in formulating proactive implementation, communications, and program strategies for successful change management and risk mitigation programs&lt;/li&gt;
