&lt;li&gt;Translate data analysis into synthesized, visually appealing insights and conclusions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide analytical support to identify opportunities, develop strategies, and prioritize projects based on team or organizational opportunities, growth targets and trends&lt;/li&gt;
