&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience in process improvement and workflow design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience presenting information and recommendations aimed at Senior Leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading and working with team members to get agreement on decision&lt;/li&gt;
