&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience with equity platforms (e.g., Fidelity, Shareworks)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience with SEC, IRS, and regulatory requirements related to equity compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with HRIS systems, preferably Workday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced skills in Microsoft Excel and G Suite applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
