&lt;li&gt;Willingness to work with pressing deadlines, prioritize tasks, and demonstrate flexibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail, organizational and analytical skills to ensure data accuracy and completeness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project management skills involving multiple teams and partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing equity systems and scalable processes&lt;/li&gt;
