&lt;p&gt;Hi, we&#39;re Oscar. We&#39;re hiring a Workday Reporting &amp;amp; Analytics Lead to join our People Analytics team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oscar is the first health insurance company built around a full stack technology platform and a relentless focus on serving our members. We started Oscar in 2012 to create the kind of health insurance company we would want for ourselves—one that behaves like a doctor in the family.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will serve as the product owner and technical architect for our reporting ecosystem, ensuring people data is accurate, automated, and scalable. This position is responsible for the end-to-end delivery of standardized Workday reporting solutions, leading the governance framework to establish uniform company-wide metric definitions (such as headcount and retention) to eliminate offline data manipulation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report into the Senior Manager, People Analytics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Location: &lt;/strong&gt;This position is based in our New York City office, requiring a hybrid work schedule with 3 days of in-office work per week. Thursdays are a required in-office day for team meetings and events, while your other two office days are flexible to suit your schedule. #LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency: &lt;/strong&gt;The base pay for this role is: $101,844- $133,670 per year. You are also eligible for employee benefits, participation in Oscar&#39;s unlimited vacation program, and annual performance bonuses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Productize, scale, and maintain tailored talent strategy dashboards to ensure HR Business Partners, operational teams, and business leaders have real-time, automated access to core workforce insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute monthly and quarterly leadership dashboards and presentations while continuously building automated, self-service alternatives to reduce manual deck creation over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, configure, test, and deploy dashboards tailored to the needs of our stakeholders across the People team and company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain WD reporting configuration to reduce tech debt - auditing, enhancing, and curating a centralized, searchable Report Catalog to maximize report discoverability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain Workday reporting health by leading projects to audit, enhance, and strategically decommission reports/dashboards to significantly reduce technical debt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish data definitions and calculated field metrics that serve as a single, company-wide source of truth, driving cross-functional alignment and fact-based decision making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recommends process improvements and enhancements to operations and policies based on a proactive evaluation of the current state.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead discovery discussions with stakeholders to document reporting requirements and trends while driving learning documentation and resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively audit and optimize the report catalog to minimize technical debt, while supporting development of solutions contributing to the larger People Analytics roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compliance with all applicable laws and regulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years experience developing Workday reporting and dashboard solutions, with specific expertise in creating, performance tuning, and optimizing complex Calculated Fields (e.g., Evaluate Expressions, Lookup Related Values, True/False logic) across various data sources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of Workday data structures (organizations, job architecture, supervisory organizations, etc)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building interactive dashboards and data pipelines using Workday Discovery Boards, Workday Prism Analytics, or specialized People Analytics/BI tools (e.g., Visier, Tableau, PowerBI) to blend external data sources and drive stakeholder self-service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency leveraging Generative AI platforms (e.g., Google Gemini) and prompt engineering as a technical lever to rapidly prototype, debug data logic, and automate routine technical documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
